            },
            "description": {
              "value": "Your familiar can shed its material form, becoming a mass of animated magic. Your familiar gains the Stitching Strike activity.\n\n**Stitching Strike [2 actions]**\nYour familiar unravels into magical fibers that encompass an enemy within 30 feet and deal 6d6 slashing damage, with a basic Reflex save against your spell DC. On a failure, the target is also immobilized for 1 round or until it Escapes against your spell DC. Your familiar then re-forms in its original square."
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "levelled_description",
          "stats": {
            "id": "levelled_description_6a4e3dba33b4",
            "level": {
              "value": 9
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "And every 2 levels thereafter, the attack deals an additional 2d6 damage."
            }
          }
        }
